{"id": "t085-002", "text": "Shreya lives in Leeds now, works at the hospital as a radiographer. Her husband Aneesh is a teacher. Two kids, both at primary.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the hospital as a radiographer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "at primary", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t085-004", "text": "Erin's birthday is 8/22. She's really into bouldering lately and keeps talking about getting her own chalk bag and shoes. Maybe go in with Jack on something.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeps talking about getting her own chalk bag and shoes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go in with Jack on something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t085-005", "text": "Caught up with Fang after work. Her daughter Mila starts nursery next Monday morning and Fang is nervous about the drop off, Mila less so. Her partner can't do it because of work. Need to text Fang Monday afternoon to see how it went. Mila is apparently obsessed with her lunchbox already and won't let anyone else touch it. Fang's mum is flying over from Guangzhou for a couple of weeks to help out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the drop off", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Fang", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lunchbox", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Guangzhou", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t085-007", "text": "Andile's 40th party was meant to be Saturday the 18th but it's called off, his dad's in hospital. Should ring him this weekend and see how his dad is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 18th"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t085-011", "text": "Yosef lives two streets from my sister, funnily enough. Works remote for a fintech in Tel Aviv. Partner is called Sara, they've been together about ten years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives two streets from", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works remote for a fintech", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "together about ten years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}]}
{"id": "t085-014", "text": "Rang Aidan. His mum had her knee op last Tuesday and she's home now but struggling with the stairs. He's going up every weekend. Should check in with him again Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the stairs", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-015", "text": "Ayesha is vegan and allergic to tree nuts. Keep in mind for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to tree nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t085-017", "text": "Bumped into Juan at the station. His son got into Manchester for medicine, starts in September. Juan's chuffed but also dreading the empty house. Send congrats to the son, Mateo I think. He's driving him up on the 14th at 10am with a car full of stuff. His wife is not coping as well as she lets on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Manchester for medicine", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the empty house", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send congrats to the son, Mateo", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving him up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 10am", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping as well as she lets on", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t085-018", "text": "Mustafa's wedding was supposed to be August 12th but they've postponed it to next spring. His fiancee Shanice's grandma passed away last month and the family needs time. Should send Shanice a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 12th"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancee", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Shanice a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t085-022", "text": "Spoke to Julia on the phone. Her brother Joseph has his PhD viva on the 21st at 10am and is a total wreck about it. Julia is flying back from Madrid the night before so she can be there after. Don't forget to text Joe good luck the morning of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD viva", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wreck", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Madrid", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Joe good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-024", "text": "Had a long catch up with Jack and Fang at the pub. Jack's dad retires at the end of May after 35 years at the post office, and there's a do at the social club on May 31st at 8. Fang's thinking about leaving her job, hates her new manager. Jack wants a group present for his dad, maybe a decent bottle of whisky. I'm bringing the cake.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years at the post office", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do at the social club", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 31st at 8", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fang", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about leaving her job", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates her new manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "decent bottle of whisky", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t085-027", "text": "Andile lives with his parents in Croydon while they save for a deposit. He and his girlfriend Amara both work in the city, he's in insurance.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Croydon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "save for a deposit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "work in the city", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "in insurance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t085-028", "text": "Farid called. His mum's moving in with them in July since his dad died last year. He's worried about how the kids will cope with the space. Their youngest Zofia is only two. I should pop round one evening next week. His wife Salma is being amazing about it but they've had to give up the spare room and her home office.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "only two", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t085-031", "text": "Cancelled dinner with Pieter tonight, he's ill. Rearrange for next week sometime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ill", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Rearrange", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week sometime", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-033", "text": "Aidan mentioned his girlfriend Ayesha has a big interview at the BBC on Thursday at 11. She's done three rounds already. Remember to ask Aidan Friday how it went. Ayesha's not told her current boss anything. If she gets it she'd be starting in January on the documentaries team, which is what she's always wanted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the BBC", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Aidan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January"}]}
{"id": "t085-035", "text": "Alice and Juan's son Leo turns 1 on 4/27! Party the Sunday after, 26th? No wait, it's the Saturday, 1pm at their house. They've asked for no presents but books are fine. I'm making a little photo book.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 1", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/27", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "26th"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday, 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "no presents but books are fine", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t085-038", "text": "Mila and her boyfriend split up. She's moving back to her mum's for a while.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t085-041", "text": "Note to self: dentist on the 15th at 9:30, then work from home the rest of the day.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th at 9:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "work from home", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-042", "text": "Talked to Joseph about his kids. Daughter Kalani is starting secondary in September and is nervous about the bus. Son is 8, plays football Saturday mornings. Joseph's wife is a nurse doing nights at the moment. Joseph seemed tired, said nights are hard on all of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the bus", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "8", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday mornings"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing nights", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t085-044", "text": "Zofia has her driving test on July 18 at 3:15. Third attempt. Text her good luck that morning, and don't mention the last one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 18 at 3:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "don't mention the last one", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t085-045", "text": "Called Nadia. Her brother Aneesh had his gallbladder out on Monday, all went fine, home Wednesday. Her mum is staying with him till the weekend. Nadia herself is off to Kerala on the 12th for two weeks, then her cousin's engagement party on the 30th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his gallbladder out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the weekend"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Kerala", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t085-047", "text": "Amara said her little boy Farid lost his first tooth and the tooth fairy situation is getting expensive. She's back at work part time, three days a week at the pharmacy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his first tooth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "part time, three days a week at the pharmacy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t085-050", "text": "Kalani's mum Mrs Ito is in hospital again with her heart. Kalani's been driving back and forth to Brighton all week, exhausted. Remind me to drop some food round to Kalani on Wednesday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Ito", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "heart", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round to Kalani", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-051", "text": "Aidan works at Deloitte, lives in Clapham with two flatmates. Brother Kevin is a chef in Edinburgh.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at Deloitte", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Clapham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "chef", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t085-052", "text": "Beatriz's son Jack had his first gig with the school band last night. Apparently he was brilliant. Ask him about it next time I see them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beatriz", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first gig with the school band", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him about it", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time I see them", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t085-053", "text": "Shreya's hen do was meant to be the 25th in Brighton but she's called the whole thing off, wedding's off too. She and Xavier broke up last week. Should take her for a coffee soon. She said Xavier's moved out already and taken the dog. Her mum is coming to stay for a few days.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 25th"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t085-054", "text": "Sara's into pottery now, does a class every Tuesday evening. Wants a wheel of her own one day. Birthday is May 3rd.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "does a class every Tuesday evening", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants a wheel of her own", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "one day"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t085-055", "text": "Lunch with Alice and Zofia. Alice's husband is away in Singapore for work until June 20th, so she's solo with the twins. Zofia just got a cat, Pickle. Zofia is also going for a promotion, interview Monday at 9.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away in Singapore", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until June 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Pickle", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 9", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t085-060", "text": "Went for a walk with Liam. He's been really down since his dog Rufus was put to sleep last week. His sister Ayesha came up from London to be with him. I need to check on him in a few days.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rufus", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came up from London", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check on him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a few days", "anchor": "a1"}]}
